Subject: [PATCH 12/14] docs: rewrite README

Restructure the README to reflect the current two-mode architecture:
module extension (lazy, recommended) and repository rule (eager).

Add Features and How it works sections explaining multi-source failover,
per-version lazy downloads, patching, integrity checking, source tracking,
and custom version schemes.
